  "details": "The Open Beta has broken VRCBCE due to array sync failing. This is a problem across all recent versions of the pool table, as seen at Community Meetup on 05/09.\nFor proof, try starting a game of pool with two players in the world in open beta versus live:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_092437e3-aca9-4ea9-b98e-1bd8de1857a7\n\nSpecifically, attempting to access a value stored in a synced array in Update fails as the array is null.\n\nSee https://github.com/FairlySadPanda/vrcbce/blob/master/Assets/VRCBilliardsCE/Scripts/PoolStateManager.cs#L846 for the failing line in Open Beta.",
